cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these detection rules in research or writing, please cite them as below."
title: "wrg-sigma-rules"
abstract: >-
  Sigma detection rules for observed ransomware operators and threat actors,
  with multi-backend conversion (Splunk, Elastic/Kibana, OpenSearch, Wazuh),
  an MCP server, and CI-pinned corpus claims. Rules are sourced from observed
  incidents rather than generated from technique lists.
type: software
authors:
